{
  "contract": "catalog-v2/1",
  "description": "Server SDK conformance for the catalog push API (whisperr-go catalog v2 contract, section 6). Every SDK sends these exact requests for these calls and returns these results. Item inputs are given in the wire shape; each SDK test converts them to its own field naming before calling the SDK. Results are given in the wire shape too.",
